---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">GET IN TOUCH</span><h1>Let's solve something <span class="accent-text">difficult.</span></h1><p class="lede">Tell us about your IRIS architecture, integration problem or the result your engineering team needs to achieve.</p></div></section><section class="content-section"><div class="container two-col"><div><h2>Start with a conversation.</h2><p class="lede">We prefer concrete technical problems over generic requests for a quote.</p><div class="contact-cards"><div class="soft-panel"><span class="eyebrow">EMAIL</span><h3><a href="mailto:info@caretdev.com">info@caretdev.com ↗</a></h3><p>For engineering enquiries, partnerships and product discussions.</p></div><div class="soft-panel"><span class="eyebrow">OPEN SOURCE</span><h3><a href="https://github.com/caretdev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/caretdev ↗</a></h3><p>For public repositories, issues and project documentation.</p></div></div></div><div class="soft-panel"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT TO INCLUDE</span><h3>A useful first message</h3><ul class="bullets"><li>Which InterSystems products and versions you use</li><li>Your architecture and operating environment</li><li>The problem, desired outcome and constraints</li><li>Any relevant timeline or scope</li></ul><a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:info@caretdev.com?subject=Engineering%20enquiry%20%E2%80%94%20CaretDev">Email CaretDev ↗</a></div></div></section></Layout>
